{{!
    @template tool_vae/tagged_situations

    The situations tagged on a bloc of the preparation, for the part "lier": a heading, then the sentence that says none is,
    or the list of the situations, each a link to it followed by its period. Nothing at all when list is null. The parts
    touch: the template holds on one logical line, each break carried by a comment.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\tagged_situations. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces): none of them is HTML.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * list - object or null: heading; none, an object (text) or null; items, an object or null holding situations, an
      array of {url, title, period}: period is an object (text) or null

    Example context (json):
    {
        "list": {
            "heading": "Situations tagged on this bloc",
            "none": null,
            "items": {
                "situations": [
                    {
                        "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/situation.php?userid=7&fiche=RNCP100&slot=1",
                        "title": "Night round",
                        "period": {"text": "5 January 2026 - 20 March 2026"}
                    },
                    {
                        "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/situation.php?userid=7&fiche=RNCP100&slot=2",
                        "title": "Morning care",
                        "period": null
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    }
}}
{{#list}}<div class="tool-vae-linksituations mb-3"><h4 class="h5">{{heading}}</h4>{{!
}}{{#none}}<p class="text-muted">{{text}}</p>{{/none}}{{!
}}{{#items}}<ul>{{#situations}}<li><a href="{{url}}">{{title}}</a>{{!
}}{{#period}} - <span class="text-muted">{{text}}</span>{{/period}}</li>{{/situations}}</ul>{{/items}}{{!
}}</div>{{/list}}
